9,79,18],[10093,50.9,2000,63,82,17],[10094,50.4,2000,63,90,18]],"links":[["Polk County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/florida/polk-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 17 grids in Polk County runs from 1951 to 2025, and November to December came in under 90% of normal in 41 of those 75 years. In 2025, March to April on the middle came in at 23% of normal and October to November at 46%. So far in 2026, January to February on the middle came in at 44% of normal. Grid 9196 had its driest year in 2000 at 54%.</p>"}
